-- MULTIPLAYER DOTS  ·  open this on two devices in the same room and move around.
-- Everyone in the room sees everyone else's dot, live, via the huntd relay.
-- Arrow keys / D-pad to move.

join game "dots" room "lobby"
-- start somewhere random so two players don't land on the same spot
me is {x: 64, y: 64}
me.x is 16 + random 96
me.y is 16 + random 96

to update
  if key "right" is held me.x is me.x + 1.5
  if key "left" is held  me.x is me.x - 1.5
  if key "up" is held    me.y is me.y - 1.5
  if key "down" is held  me.y is me.y + 1.5
  -- share my position a few times a second (don't flood the relay)
  every 5 frames
    broadcast {x: me.x, y: me.y}

to draw
  clear screen to dark blue
  -- everyone else, in red
  each peer in peers
    draw rect at peer.x, peer.y size 6, 6 in red
  -- me, in white, on top
  draw rect at me.x, me.y size 6, 6 in white
  others is the number of peers
  write "you + {others} others" at 2, 2 in white on hud

run game with update and draw
